WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:00,920
King

2
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:02,170
Weichen is here to give you good news

3
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:03,890
Li Shangshu looked anxious

4
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:07,210
But the Ministry of War's errand encountered difficulties. Gu Kede's difficulty was not difficult, King

5
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,890
Duo Weichen's clever calculation has led to chaos for several days.

6
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,650
Wei Chen thought you were responsible for the 30,000 tigers and wolves

7
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:11,610
What is this

8
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,500
You recruited 30,000 people

9
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,700
That's natural

10
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,020
Weak ministers are not yours, the king.

11
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,180
Xiao He again

12
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,580
This method of logistical recruitment

13
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:19,940
Wei Chen claims to be second in the world

14
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,140
Who dares to recognize the number one?

15
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,900
But, my lord

16
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,300
This Anjia Qinzi who recruited 30,000 troops

17
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,020
All of them are weak ministers who have escaped and have to report to the palace. Do you think the king should give it to the weak ministers?

18
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,340
Reimbursement is reimbursed

19
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,340
Li Aiqing

20
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,380
It’s not like you don’t know

21
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,540
Gu's new dynasty has just gained a foothold

22
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,700
I can't even get out a tael of silver from the treasury.

23
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,660
The majestic king of a country

24
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,140
You can't just waste your hard-earned money in vain, right?

25
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,140
Since the king has no cash,

26
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,060
Why not write an IOU to Wei Chen?

27
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,340
Gu Nai, the majestic king of the big fish army

28
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,620
You asked Gu to write you a note, right?

29
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,060
How about settling accounts between brothers?

30
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,740
The principal is a full 150,000 taels of silver

31
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,740
For the sake of the king

32
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,860
One company only charges 1% in interest.

33
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,060
Li Aiqing

34
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,740
You and I, our soldiers and ministers, share weal and woe

35
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,940
Now even this little money

36
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:54,020
Is it so clear that everyone has the same identity?

37
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,780
Then we must make a clear distinction: I am a minister

38
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:56,740
The army is the army

39
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:58,660
Unless we become the humble servant of the family

40
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:01,300
Of course it’s the king’s money

41
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:02,340
The minister is casual and garbled

42
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:03,300
Your Majesty, forgive me.

43
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:05,620
What a smooth-tongued lunatic.

44
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,140
Isn’t it okay for me to give you an IOU?

45
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:10,690
Owe Li Zhusha 150,000 taels of silver

46
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:12,490
Thank you, King. Farewell.
